      "_id": "6ae9f6061154a1055518bbc5",
      "title": "28년 세계 도보를 마친 영국인에게 쏟아진 영웅의 환영",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/brYK43Y4Osw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"28년 세계 도보를 마친 영국인에게 쏟아진 영웅의 환영\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">28년간 세계를 걸어 돌아온 영국인에게 영웅의 환영이 쏟아졌다는 The Guardian 기사에서 여정·탐험 관련 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">After a 28-year <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">odyssey</mark> spanning 29 countries</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">29개국에 걸친 28년간의 대장정 끝에</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. odyssey: 대장정, 긴 여정 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">led a scientific <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">expedition</mark> across the frozen tundra</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">얼어붙은 툰드라를 가로지르는 과학 탐험을 이끌었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. expedition: 탐험, 원정 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">embarked on an arduous <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">journey</mark> across the continent</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">대륙을 가로지르는 고된 여정에 나섰다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. journey: 여정, 장거리 여행 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">completed a solo sea <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">voyage</mark> around the globe</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">단독 세계 일주 항해를 마쳤다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. voyage: 항해, 긴 여행 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">survived a grueling <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">trek</mark> through the dense jungle</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">빽빽한 밀림을 통과하는 몹시 고된 도보 여정을 견뎌냈다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. trek: 길고 힘든 도보 여행 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">mapped out a strict <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">itinerary</mark> covering five major cities</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">주요 도시 다섯 곳을 방문하는 엄격한 여행 일정을 짰다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. itinerary: 여행 일정표, 여행 경로 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">cut short a brief <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">sojourn</mark> in a remote mountain village</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">외딴 산골 마을에서의 짧은 체류를 예정보다 일찍 끝냈다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. sojourn: 일시적인 체류, 체재 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">undertook a spiritual <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">pilgrimage</mark> to the sacred peak</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">성스러운 산봉우리를 향해 영적인 순례에 나섰다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. pilgrimage: 순례, 성지 참배 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">recounted tales from years of solitary <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">wayfaring</mark></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">수년간 홀로 걸어서 여행하며 겪은 이야기들을 들려주었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. wayfaring: 도보 여행, 여행하는 (명·형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=brYK43Y4Osw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Guardian | ‘It’s been a while’: hero’s welcome for UK man after 28-year walk across the world | By Josh Halliday | Mon 2 Nov 2026</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/02/karl-bushby-uk-hull-28-year-walk-across-world\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
